WEBVTT

00:00:05.716 --> 00:00:08.846
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Can I have a cheese sandwich please?

00:00:19.581 --> 00:00:20.358
<v><b>Barman:</b></v> Anything else?

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:32.502
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> And a Coke, please.

00:00:42.927 --> 00:00:43.696
<v><b>Barman:</b></v> Ice and lemon?

00:00:53.882 --> 00:00:54.533
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> No, thanks.

00:01:04.572 --> 00:01:05.606
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> How much is it?

00:01:16.148 --> 00:01:16.768
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Here you are.

00:01:27.142 --> 00:01:27.978
<v><b>Barman:</b></v> Here’s your change.

00:01:37.927 --> 00:01:38.985
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> I’m fine, too.

00:01:48.948 --> 00:01:49.668
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> Wait for me.

00:01:59.599 --> 00:02:00.493
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Sure!

00:02:10.486 --> 00:02:11.724
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Great idea.